<%- include("../partials/head") %>
<h1>Batch Staged</h1>
<p><strong>Open this link on your phone now.</strong> It is shown only on this page. If you leave or refresh it, it
    cannot be shown again, and reloading would stage a second batch.</p>
<p><%= staged %> <%= staged === 1 ? "customer" : "customers" %> staged from <%= areaName %> (batch <%= batchId %>), each
    link good for <%= days %> days once made.</p>
<p><a href="<%= deepLink %>">Open in Messenger</a></p>
<label for="deep-link">Link to Copy</label>
<input id="deep-link" type="text" readonly value="<%= deepLink %>" size="70">
<% if (expoLink) { %>
    <label for="expo-link">Expo Go Link (Development Only)</label>
    <input id="expo-link" type="text" readonly value="<%= expoLink %>" size="70">
    <p>Expo Go cannot open the link above. Scan this with your phone's camera, or copy the link to it.</p>
    <%- expoQr %>
<% } %>
<ul>
    <li>Messenger can open the batch for <%= fetchMinutes %> minutes, and report results for <%= resultsHours %> hours.</li>
    <li>Anyone who opens the link in that time can see the batch, so send it only to your own phone.</li>
    <% if (noPhone > 0) { %>
        <li><%= noPhone %> <%= noPhone === 1 ? "customer was" : "customers were" %> left out for having no usable phone.</li>
    <% } %>
    <% if (skippedActive > 0) { %>
        <li><%= skippedActive %> already <%= skippedActive === 1 ? "has" : "have" %> a working link and <%= skippedActive === 1 ? "was" : "were" %> skipped.</li>
    <% } %>
</ul>
<p><a href="/staff/messenger-batches/<%= batchId %>">See who was texted</a></p>
<%- include("../partials/foot") %>
